    "description": "Educational Rock Mineral Sample Set Labeled Gneiss Hornblende Quartz 4lbs\nThis set contains assorted educational rock and mineral samples labeled with numbers or names including Gneiss, Hornblende, and quartz-like specimens. Each sample is individually bagged in clear plastic zip bags. The set weighs approximately 4.03 pounds. The rocks vary in size, shape, and color, featuring gray, black, white, and brown tones. Gneiss is a metamorphic rock with a banded appearance; hornblende is a dark mineral. Samples are used but in good condition. Suitable for classroom teaching, geology study, or collectors. No brand or manufacturer information is available.\nDetails",
